{"availability":"available","full":"robbestad/Rantjs","name":"Rantjs","description":"Write a pattern, get a sentence. Seeded procedural text for JavaScript.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":218,"forks":8,"created":"2014-12-12T05:22:54Z","updated":"2026-09-04T09:38:43Z","license":"ISC","branch":"master","homepage":"https://rantjs.vercel.app","topics":["cli","dictionary","flavor-text","game-development","generative-text","javascript","nlg","npm-package","procedural-generation","procedural-text","rant","seeded-random","text-generation","tracery","typescript"],"demo":"https://rantjs.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T09:08:16.867Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T09:08:16.867Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T09:08:16.867Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T09:08:16.867Z","stars":218,"forks":8}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Write a pattern. Get a sentence. A seeded procedural-text engine for JavaScript — names, verbs, places, and the glue between them — without a template language, a model call, or a bag of Math.random().","Live demo · Short story generator · Inspired by Rant. This is the Rantjs dialect (, [rep:3]{...}), not a Rant 4 VM.","rantjs 3.0 is frozen. The next language is Skald (skald-lang on npm): the same pattern shape, a Rust+WASM VM, dictionary entries as values, rhyme, channels, and explain(). Seeds are not portable."],"features":["One function. rant(pattern) returns a string. Compile the pattern when you will run it more than once.","Repeatable. The same pattern plus the same seed is the same sentence. That makes tests, save games, and LLM pipelines honest.","Characters stay themselves. Name a result once () and reuse it () so the hero does not change gender mid-paragraph.","A real dictionary. Compiled from Rantionary, indexed by class. Queries do not scan the whole noun table to find animals.","A small language. Queries, weighted blocks, repeaters, articles, case, synchronizers. You describe the shape of the text; the dictionary fills it."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/robbestad/Rantjs/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"1a3dbf9062f470684329ef00e95b91656c6fc3f0c945833d74ea5583d53e2336","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T09:08:17.056Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T09:08:17.056Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Write a pattern. Get a sentence. A seeded procedural-text engine for JavaScript — names, verbs, places, and the glue between them — without a template language, a model call, or a bag of Math.random().","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/robbestad/Rantjs/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"1a3dbf9062f470684329ef00e95b91656c6fc3f0c945833d74ea5583d53e2336","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/robbestad/Rantjs/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T09:08:17.056Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-04T09:38:43Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/robbestad/Rantjs/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T09:08:17.057Z","hash":"1a3dbf9062f470684329ef00e95b91656c6fc3f0c945833d74ea5583d53e2336","originalBytes":10428,"storedBytes":10428,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["rant","rantjs","pattern","dictionary","run","import","seed","name","npm","nsfw","compile","tables","block","next","one","pet","same","entries","explain","query","text","build","createrant","demo","engine","options","random","sep","shape","string","unknown","alias","blocks","browser","carrier","case","channels","dic","does","english","install","node","only","pass","plural","queries","rep","shipped","tags","title","without","word","animal","api","bash","call","carriers","chance","const","custom","default","enus","esm","female","filters","generator","join","live","locked","longer","male","noun","output","place","repeat","rhyme","runs","svenjs","tag","true","write","adj","adv","braces","branch","builders","capybara","capybaras","class","class.","classes",